      "id": "claim_d228e1e00daf4080a999bba99f6f0ebc",
      "statement": "Outbound RestClient connect/read timeouts and redirect policy are configured via the plural spring.http.clients.connect-timeout/read-timeout/redirects keys (metadata in spring-boot-http-client-*.jar); the deprecated singular spring.http.client.* keys are silently not bound in Spring Boot 4.",
