    {
      "id": "claim_1cbee4ab3bf342d09d646229809c8ac8",
      "statement": "InterestScoringConfig defines the interestScoringExecutor ThreadPoolTaskExecutor bean (threads jev-score-) registered with defaultCandidate=false so it never satisfies Boot's @ConditionalOnMissingBean(Executor.class) and does not replace applicationTaskExecutor; core and max pool size both equal myfeeder.interest.concurrency, and the bounded queue keeps the default abort rejection policy on purpose so ScoringQueue can catch TaskRejectedException and release the article id for retry by the sweep.",
